# Curated Signal K plugins and webapps for HaLOS Marine.
#
# Baked into the image at build time, into the signalk-server package root.
# The Signal K app store can still update any entry afterwards; those updates land
# in the data volume, which shadows the baked copy and wins.
#
# Do not list packages signalk-server already ships as dependencies -- their
# assertion would pass whether or not the bake did anything.

# Webapps (UI)
@signalk/freeboard-sk
@halos-org/skip
@signalk/charts-plugin


# NMEA I/O
@signalk/signalk-to-nmea0183
signalk-to-nmea2000
signalk-n2kais-to-nmea0183
@signalk/udp-nmea-plugin
@signalk/set-system-time

# Derived / performance / vessel state
signalk-derived-data
signalk-polar-performance-plugin
@meri-imperiumi/signalk-autostate

# Safety
signalk-anchoralarm-plugin

# Sensors / misc
signalk-flags

# Logging (configured with the InfluxDB token by prestart)
signalk-to-influxdb2

# Automation
@signalk/signalk-node-red
